\item[S1]J. Franke, Y. I. Manin, Y. Tschinkel, Invent. Math. 95(2):421-435, 1989.
\url{https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01393829}.
\textit{Formulation source.}
\item[E1]Runxuan Gao, The geometric exceptional set in Manin's conjecture for Batyrev and Tschinkel's example, arXiv:2311.04138v3, Introduction and Proposition 1.4.
\url{https://arxiv.org/html/2311.04138v3}.
\textit{Added primary source: the failure of the closed-exceptional-set formulation and the distinction from thin-set refinements. Consulted 24 September 2026.}
